# Disable end-of-line translation repo-wide: store and check out bytes exactly as-is.
#
# harness/ is a verbatim copy of the official starter kit, and its scenario files are
# SHA-256 pinned by scenario_manifest.json. The platform only re-scores identically while our
# copies stay byte-identical, but Windows core.autocrlf would silently rewrite their LF
# endings on checkout. Files in this repo are authored with LF, so "no conversion" also keeps
# our own sources consistent without a second rule to maintain.
* -text
